WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:04.400
Independence.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:10.480
With that declaration America was born.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:15.170
Inspired by a belief in the God-given rights
of every human being.

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:25.240
That among these are Life, Liberty and the
pursuit of Happiness.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:30.450
Our government was established to secure these
rights, and for the good that comes from exercising

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:32.020
them well.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:39.000
This is why the founders of our great nation
chose independence.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.090
As do we.

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:47.620
Hillsdale College accepts no government funding.

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:52.500
Because independence, makes possible the good
to which we aspire.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.660
Hillsdale College. Pursuing truth and defending liberty since 1844.

